                    "geolocation",
                    "geofences"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Retrieves the list of active geofences registered with the GeofenceMonitor. Geofences are geographic areas (circles) that trigger events when the device enters, exits, or dwells in the area."
              },
              "response": [
